 James MatternMario Vitolo is a second-generation chef and restaurateur who 
 has spent most of his life at Ballato\, one of New York City's most respect
 ed Italian restaurants. Mario began working at the restaurant at age 10 und
 er the guidance of his parents. Over the years\, he learned every aspect of
  the business\, from preparing sauces and desserts to cooking seafood and b
 aking the restaurant's signature focaccia. He also developed the hospitalit
 y style that has become a hallmark of the Ballato experience. Whether welco
 ming first-time guests or longtime regulars\, Mario is known for creating a
 n atmosphere that feels personal and genuine. Today\, Mario continues to bu
 ild on the traditions that have defined Ballato for decades while bringing 
 his own approach to hospitality and Italian cuisine. His focus remains simp
 le: serve great food\, make guests feel at home\, and create memorable dini
 ng experiences.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/mang
